<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merill reinstates Nextel.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merill reinstates Nextel.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said analyst Linda Runyon reinstated Nextel Communications Inc with near- and long-term accumulate ratings.</p>
<p>-- The analyst set a target price of $20.</p>
<p>-- She estimated the wireless communications provider would report a loss of $2.35 for fiscal 1996 and a loss of $1.85 in 1997.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
